helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0600.xhp	0	help	par_id3151111				0	is	$[officename] kemur með forritunarviðmóti (Application Programming Interface - API) sem gerir þér kleift að stýra ýmsum $[officename] einingum með margvíslegum forritunarmálum. Í boði er $[officename] Software Development Kit fyrir forritunarviðmótið.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0600.xhp	0	help	par_id3156346				0	is	For more information about $[officename] API reference, please visit \<link href=\"https://api.openoffice.org/\"\>api.openoffice.org\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
