helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01030400.xhp	0	help	par_id3152576				0	is	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Macros - Organize Macros - %PRODUCTNAME Basic\</emph\> and click \<emph\>Organizer\</emph\> or click the \<emph\>Select Module\</emph\> icon in the Basic IDE to open the \<emph\>Macro Organizer\</emph\> dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
