helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3151262				0	is	Displays a prompt in a dialog at which the user can input text. The input is assigned to a variable.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03010201.xhp	0	help	par_id3151100				0	is	The \<emph\>InputBox\</emph\> statement is a convenient method of entering text through a dialog. Confirm the input by clicking OK or pressing Return. The input is returned as the function return value. If you close the dialog with Cancel, \<emph\>InputBox\</emph\> returns a zero-length string ("").				20181231 09:50:43
