helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020405.xhp	0	help	par_id3149959				0	is	2: The FileAttr-Function returns the file access number of the operating system.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020405.xhp	0	help	par_id3154018				0	is	If you specify a parameter attribute with a value of 1, the following return values apply:				20181231 09:50:43
