helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020405.xhp	0	help	par_id3155066				0	is	4 - RANDOM (file open for random access)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020405.xhp	0	help	par_id3148406				0	is	8 - APPEND (file open for appending)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020405.xhp	0	help	par_id3154757				0	is	32 - BINARY (file open in binary mode).				20181231 09:50:43
