helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155941				0	is	Use this area to enter sorting criteria. If you enter additional sorting criteria under \<emph\>and then\</emph\>, the data matching the content of the higher-order criterion is ordered according to the next criterion.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148620				0	is	If you sort the field name "First name" in ascending order and the field name "last name" in descending order, all records will be sorted in ascending order by first name, and then within the first names, in descending order by last name.				20181231 09:50:43
