helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150445				0	is	Use the \<emph\>New Document\</emph\> tab from the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/09070000.xhp\" name=\"Hyperlink dialog\"\>Hyperlink dialog\</link\> to set up a hyperlink to a new document and create the new document simultaneously.				20181231 09:50:43
