helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154398				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:PrintDefault\"\>Click the \<emph\>Print File Directly\</emph\> icon to print the active document with the current default print settings.\</ahelp\> These can be found in the \<emph\>Printer Setup\</emph\> dialog, which you can call with the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01140000.xhp\" name=\"Printer Settings\"\>\<emph\>Printer Settings\</emph\>\</link\> menu command.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147275	3			0	is	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>If you select text or a graphic and click the \<emph\>Print File Direct\</emph\> icon, you are prompted to print the selection or the document. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01110000.xhp	0	help	par_id9547105				0	is	If the current document uses a printer that is not the default printer for your operating system, the \<emph\>Print File Direct \</emph\>icon opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01130000.xhp\"\>\<emph\>Print\</emph\>\</link\> dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01110000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10679				0	is	If the current document uses a printer that is not the default printer that was specified in the \<link href=\"text/shared/guide/spadmin.xhp\"\>spadmin\</link\>, printer administration program, the \<emph\>Print File Direct \</emph\>icon opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01130000.xhp\"\>\<emph\>Print\</emph\>\</link\> dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	tit				0	is	Special Tips for Table Controls				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	bm_id3109850				0	is	\<bookmark_value\>table controls; properties\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>controls; properties of table controls\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>table controls;keyboard-only edit mode\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	hd_id3109850				0	is	Special Tips for Table Controls				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3153539				0	is	You can define a table control to display the records as you like. In other words you can define data fields for displaying or editing data like in a database form.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3152372				0	is	The following fields are possible in a table control: text, date, time and currency field, numeric field, pattern field, check box and combo box. In the case of combined date/time fields, two columns are created automatically.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3159194				0	is	The number of selected lines, if any are selected, is in parentheses after the total number of records.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3155616				0	is	To insert columns into the table control, click in the column heads and bring up the context menu. The following commands are available:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150789				0	is	Setja inn dálk				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3153750				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_INSERTCOL\"\>Calls a submenu to select a data field to adopt it in the table control.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3155552				0	is	Configure the table control using drag and drop: Open the data source browser and drag the desired fields out of the data source browser and on to the column heads of the table control. A pre-configured column is created.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149827				0	is	Setja í staðinn				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\"SID_FM_CHANGECOL\"\>Opens a submenu to select a data field to replace the data field selected in the table control.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170004.xhp	0	help	hd_id3143267				0	is	Eyða Hópur				20181231 09:50:43
