helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\24030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149511				0	is	\<image id=\"img_id3146130\" src=\"res/sc10865.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3146130\"\>Táknmynd\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
