helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154288				0	is	Sjálfvirk röðun				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170300.xhp	0	help	par_id3153748	11			0	is	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SVXDLG_TAB_ORDER_PB_AUTO_ORDER\"\>Click the\<emph\> Automatic Sort\</emph\> button to automatically sort the controls according to their position in the document.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
