helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159197				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Ellipse\"\>Draws an oval where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to draw the oval, and drag to the size you want. To draw a circle, hold down Shift while you drag.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155308				0	is	Marghyrningur				20181231 09:50:43
