helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153223				0	is	To define one character of the label as a mnemonic, so that the user can access this control by pressing the character on the keyboard, insert a tilde (~) character in front of the character in the label.				20181231 09:50:43
