helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148874				0	is	for exactly one arbitrary character				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150365				0	is	"?loppy" returns "Floppy"				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3166426				0	is	"M?ller" returns, for example, Miller and Moller				20181231 09:50:43
