helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153748				0	is	Tölvupóstfang				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3166460				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_HYPERLINK_MAIL_RB_LINKTYP_MAIL\"\>Assigns the specified e-mail address to the hyperlink.\</ahelp\> Clicking the new hyperlink in the document will open a new message document, addressed to the receiver specified in the \<emph\>E-mail\</emph\> field.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155628				0	is	Fréttir				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149955				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_HYPERLINK_MAIL_RB_LINKTYP_NEWS\"\>Assigns a news address to the hyperlink.\</ahelp\> Clicking the hyperlink in the document will open a new message document to the news group you entered in the \<emph\>Receiver\</emph\> field.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149580				0	is	Móttakandi				20181231 09:50:43
