helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01171300.xhp	0	help	par_id3149495				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies whether to move frames, drawing elements, and controls only between grid points.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01171300.xhp	0	help	par_id3156027				0	is	\<image id=\"img_id3157896\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_griduse.png\" width=\"0.1665inch\" height=\"0.1665inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3157896\"\>Táknmynd\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
