helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155364				0	is	The following comparative operators can be set under \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Condition\</item\> in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Standard Filter\</item\> dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3145313	3			0	is	                  \<emph\>Comparative operator\</emph\>               				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147089	4			0	is	                  \<emph\>Brella\</emph\>               				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147209				0	is	Jafnt (=)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146797				0	is	Shows values equal to the condition.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3143271				0	is	Minna en (<)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153761				0	is	Shows values less than the condition.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146807				0	is	Stærra en (>)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154852				0	is	Shows values greater than the condition.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155342				0	is	Minna eða jafnt og (< =)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154381				0	is	Shows values that are less than or equal to the condition.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153823				0	is	Stærra eða jafnt og (> =)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154143				0	is	Shows values that are greater than or equal to the condition.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154811				0	is	Ekki jafnt (< >)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148944				0	is	Shows the values not equal to the condition.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149669				0	is	Stærst				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3159413				0	is	Shows the N (numeric value as parameter) largest values.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151054				0	is	Minnstu				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3161657				0	is	Shows the N (numeric value as parameter) smallest values.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150400				0	is	Stærsta %				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3161645				0	is	Shows the largest N% (numeric value as parameter) of the total values.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149202				0	is	Minnsta %				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151176				0	is	Shows the smallest N% (numeric value as parameter) of the entire values.				20181231 09:50:43
