helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000200.xhp	0	help	par_id1				0	is	When you export graphical elements to a file, you can select the file type. For most supported file types a dialog opens where you can setup export options.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000200.xhp	0	help	par_id2				0	is	The following file types do not show an options dialog: PWP, RAS, SVG, TIFF, XPM.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000200.xhp	0	help	par_id3				0	is	The other file types show options dialogs where you can set the width and height of the exported image.				20181231 09:50:43
