helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000200.xhp	0	help	par_id355152952				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Sets the compression and quality for the export. Choose from a low quality with minimal file size, up to a high quality and big file size. A high compression means a low quality, a low compression means a high quality.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
