helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000200.xhp	0	help	par_id35674840				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies whether the graphic is to be saved in interlaced mode.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000200.xhp	0	help	par_id14				0	is	For GIF files you can set the transparency and the interlaced mode.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000200.xhp	0	help	par_id31456456938				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies whether to save the background of the picture as transparent. Only objects will be visible in the GIF image. Use the Color Replacer to set the transparent color in the picture.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
