helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000003.xhp	0	help	par_idN10715				0	is	For example, in a text document, open \<emph\>Format - Paragraph - Indents & Spacing\</emph\>. To indent the current paragraph by one inch, enter \<item type=\"literal\"\>1 in\</item\> or \<item type=\"literal\"\>1"\</item\> into the "Before text" box. To indent the paragraph by 1 cm, enter \<item type=\"literal\"\>1 cm\</item\> into the input box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000003.xhp	0	help	par_idN1074C				0	is	To input the maximum or minimum allowed value respectively, click the current value and then press the \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Page Up\</item\> or \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Page Down\</item\> key.				20181231 09:50:43
