helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3156329				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:EDIT:RID_SCDLG_ASCII:ED_OTHER\"\>Separates data into columns using the custom separator that you specify. Note: The custom separator must also be contained in your data.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
