helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3153178				0	is	Numbers formatted in US English are searched for and included regardless of the system language. A number format is not applied. If there are no US English entries, the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> format is applied.				20181231 09:50:43
