helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3147377				0	is	Shows how the imported text will look after it is separated into columns. To apply a format to a column when it is imported, click a column and select a \<emph\>Column type\</emph\>. When you select a \<emph\>Column type\</emph\>, the column heading displays the applied format.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3150105				0	is	If you want to use a fixed width to separate the imported data into columns, click in the ruler to set the width boundaries.				20181231 09:50:43
