helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\webwizard00.xhp	0	help	par_idN1055D				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\"34200\"\>The Web Wizard helps you to maintain a web site on an Internet server.\</ahelp\>The Web Wizard converts files in a local folder to a web format and uploads the files to the server. The wizard also uses one of the supplied templates to create an index page that contains hyperlinks to the uploaded files.				20181231 09:50:43
