helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150275				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\"SD:RADIOBUTTON:DLG_PUBLISHING:PAGE2_CHG_DEFAULT\"\>The slide transition depends on the timing that you set for each slide in the presentation. If you set a manual page transition, the HTML presentation introduces a new page by pressing any key from your keyboard.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
