helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\autocorr_url.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149346				0	is	\<variable id=\"autocorr_url\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/autocorr_url.xhp\" name=\"Turning off Automatic URL Recognition\"\>Turning off Automatic URL Recognition\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\autocorr_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	is	When you enter text, $[officename] automatically recognizes a word that may be a \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#url\" name=\"URL\"\>URL\</link\> and replaces the word with a hyperlink. $[officename] formats the hyperlink with direct font attributes (color and underline) the properties of which are obtained from certain Character Styles.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\autocorr_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3153561				0	is	If you do not want $[officename] to automatically recognize URLs as you are typing, there are several ways of turning off this feature.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\autocorr_url.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154306				0	is	Undo URL Recognition				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\autocorr_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3149233				0	is	When you are typing and notice that a text has just been automatically converted into a hyperlink, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Z to undo this formatting.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\autocorr_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3149235				0	is	If you do not notice this conversion until later, select the hyperlink and choose the menu command \<emph\>Format - Default Formatting\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\autocorr_url.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152350				0	is	Turn off URL Recognition				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\autocorr_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3149514				0	is	Load a document of the type for which you want to modify the URL recognition.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\autocorr_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3151246				0	is	If you want to modify the URL recognition for text documents, open a text document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\autocorr_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3159413				0	is	Veldu \<emph\>Verkfæri - Valkostir sjálfvirkrar leiðréttingar\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\autocorr_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3148550				0	is	In the \<emph\>AutoCorrect\</emph\> dialog, select the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\autocorr_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3153360				0	is	If you unmark \<emph\>URL Recognition\</emph\>, words will no longer be automatically replaced with hyperlinks.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\autocorr_url.xhp	0	help	par_id3156423				0	is	In $[officename] Writer there are two check boxes in front of \<emph\>URL Recognition\</emph\>. The box in the first column is for later post-editing and the box in the second column is for AutoCorrect as you type.				20181231 09:50:43
