helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3156326				0	is	Select one of the default border styles in the \<emph\>Default\</emph\> area.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\border_paragraph.xhp	0	help	par_id3154285				0	is	Select a line style and color for the selected border style in the \<emph\>Line\</emph\> area. These settings apply to all border lines that are included in the selected border style.				20181231 09:50:43
