helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	bm_id5762199				0	is	\<bookmark_value\>opening;forms\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>forms;creating\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>design view;creating forms\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN105F9				0	is	\<variable id=\"data_forms\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/data_forms.xhp\"\>Working with Forms\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10617				0	is	Using forms, you can define how to present the data. Open a text document or a spreadsheet and insert the controls such as push buttons and list boxes. In the properties dialogs of the controls, you can define what data the forms should display.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN1061A				0	is	Creating a New Form With the Form Wizard				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN1061E				0	is	In %PRODUCTNAME, you can create a new form using the \<link href=\"text/shared/autopi/01090000.xhp\"\>Form Wizard\</link\>:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10632				0	is	Open the database file where you want to create the new form.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10636				0	is	In the left pane of the database window, click the \<emph\>Forms\</emph\> icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN1063E				0	is	Click \<emph\>Use Wizard to Create Form\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10645				0	is	Creating a New Form Manually				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN1064C				0	is	Open the database file where you want to create the new form.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10650				0	is	In the left pane of the database window, click the \<emph\>Forms\</emph\> icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10658				0	is	Click \<emph\>Create Form in Design View\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN1065F				0	is	A new text document opens. Use the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170000.xhp\"\>Form Controls\</link\> to insert form controls.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_forms.xhp	0	help	par_idN10670				0	is	Click the \<emph\>Forms\</emph\> icon to access all forms that were created from within the current database window. In addition, you can use the \<emph\>Form Controls\</emph\> icons to add database form controls to any Writer or Calc document, but these documents will not be listed in the database window. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	tit				0	is	Sending Faxes and Configuring $[officename] for Faxing				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	bm_id3156426				0	is	\<bookmark_value\>faxes; sending\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>faxes;configuring $[officename]\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>sending; documents as faxes \</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>configuring;fax icon\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156426				0	is	\<variable id=\"fax\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/fax.xhp\" name=\"Sending Faxes and Configuring $[officename] for Faxing\"\>Sending Faxes and Configuring $[officename] for Faxing\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_id3156410				0	is	To send a fax directly from $[officename], you need a fax modem and a fax driver that allows applications to communicate with the fax modem.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166410				0	is	Að senda fax í gegnum Prent gluggann				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_id3152996				0	is	Open the \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog by choosing \<emph\>File - Print\</emph\> and select the fax driver in the \<emph\>Name\</emph\> list box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_id3155135				0	is	Clicking \<emph\>OK\</emph\> opens the dialog for your fax driver, where you can select the fax recipient.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153825				0	is	Configuring $[officename] a Fax Icon				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_id3153822				0	is	You can configure $[officename] so that a single click on an icon automatically sends the current document as a fax:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_id3145315				0	is	Choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040400.xhp\" name=\"Writer - Print\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Print\</link\>\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_id3150985				0	is	Select the fax driver from the \<emph\>Fax\</emph\> list box and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_idN106EB				0	is	Click the arrow icon at the end of the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> bar. In the drop-down menu, choose \<emph\>Customize\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_idN106F6				0	is	The \<emph\>Toolbar\</emph\>s tab page of the \<emph\>Customize\</emph\> dialog appears.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_idN106FA				0	is	Smella á \<emph\>Bæta við skipunum\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_idN10702				0	is	Select the "Documents" category, then select the "Send Default Fax" command.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_idN10706				0	is	Smella á \<emph\>Bæta við\</emph\> og svo \<emph\>Loka\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_idN10712				0	is	On the \<emph\>Toolbars\</emph\> tab page, click the down arrow button to position the new icon where you want it. Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fax.xhp	0	help	par_idN10715				0	is	Your \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> bar now has a new icon to send the current document as a fax.				20181231 09:50:43
