helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10771				0	is	Select one of the options and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10774				0	is	If you are in a spreadsheet and the contents of the clipboard are spreadsheet cells, then a different \<emph\>Paste Special\</emph\> dialog appears. Use the \<emph\>Paste Special\</emph\> dialog to copy cells using basic or advanced options.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN1077E				0	is	\<emph\>Transpose\</emph\>: swaps the rows and the columns of the cell range to be pasted.				20181231 09:50:43
