helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_idN105C1				0	is	A report is a Writer text document that can show your data in an organized order and formatting. In %PRODUCTNAME Base, you have a choice to create a report either manually using drag-and-drop in the Report Builder window, or semi-automatic by following a series of dialogs in the Report Wizard. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_reports.xhp	0	help	par_id4094363				0	is	The following list gives you some information to decide which method to use for your data:				20181231 09:50:43
