helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\copytext2application.xhp	0	help	par_id3156426				0	is	You can insert text into other document types, such as spreadsheets and presentations. Note that there is a difference between whether the text is inserted into a text frame, a spreadsheet cell, or into the outline view of a presentation.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\copytext2application.xhp	0	help	par_id3147576				0	is	If you copy text to the clipboard, you can paste it with or without text attributes. Use the shortcut keys \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+C to copy and \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+V to paste.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\copytext2application.xhp	0	help	par_id3152349				0	is	\<image id=\"img_id3143270\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_paste.png\" width=\"5.64mm\" height=\"5.64mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3143270\"\>Táknmynd\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\copytext2application.xhp	0	help	par_id3158430				0	is	To select the format in which the clipboard contents will be pasted, click the arrow next to the \<emph\>Paste\</emph\> icon on the Standard bar, or choose \<emph\>Edit - Paste Special\</emph\>, then select the proper format.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\copytext2application.xhp	0	help	par_id3156155				0	is	If a text document contains headings formatted with the Heading Paragraph Style, choose \<emph\>File - Send - Outline to Presentation\</emph\>. A new presentation document is created, which contains the headings as an outline.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\copytext2application.xhp	0	help	par_id3145316				0	is	If you want to transfer each heading together with its accompanying paragraphs, select the \<emph\>File - Send - AutoAbstract to Presentation\</emph\> command. You must have formatted the headings with a corresponding Paragraph Style to be able to see this command.				20181231 09:50:43
