helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3153748				0	is	Position the mouse pointer above the graphic, without clicking.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3156346				0	is	If the mouse pointer changes to a hand symbol, the graphic refers to a hyperlink. In this case, click the graphic while pressing the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key to select it without executing the respective link.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3149578				0	is	If the mouse pointer does not change to a hand symbol, you can simply click the graphic to select it.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3145120				0	is	Once the graphic is selected, release the mouse button. Click again on the graphic image, keeping the mouse button pressed for more than two seconds. The graphic image is copied to the internal memory.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\dragdrop_gallery.xhp	0	help	par_id3150772				0	is	Without releasing the mouse button, drag the graphic into the Gallery.				20181231 09:50:43
