helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id5086825				0	is	Use the toolbars and menu commands and drag-and-drop to edit the report as stated in the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/rep_main.xhp\"\>Report Builder\</link\> guide.				20181231 09:50:43
