helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3155431				0	is	You can edit the page styles for the first page and the following pages of the report as well as the paragraph styles, the number formats, the printed field labels, and more.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_idN107D7				0	is	Unless you have a thorough understanding of the database the report accesses, do not edit the SQL statement, database name, the hidden form controls, or the related information on the report.				20181231 09:50:43
