helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\labels.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150774				0	is	\<variable id=\"labels\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/labels.xhp\" name=\"Creating and Printing Labels and Business Cards\"\>Creating and Printing Labels and Business Cards\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\labels.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153345				0	is	Designing Business Cards Through a Dialog				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\labels.xhp	0	help	par_id3146798	70			0	is	Choose \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01010300.xhp\" name=\"File - New - Business Cards\"\>\<emph\>File - New - Business Cards\</emph\>\</link\> to open the\<emph\> Business Cards \</emph\>dialog, which allows you to choose how your business cards will look.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\labels.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147654				0	is	Designing Labels and Business Cards				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\labels.xhp	0	help	par_id3152349				0	is	You can design both labels and business cards through the \<emph\>Labels\</emph\> dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\labels.xhp	0	help	par_id3153880				0	is	Choose \<link href=\"text/shared/01/01010200.xhp\" name=\"File - New - Labels\"\>\<emph\>File - New - Labels\</emph\>\</link\> to open the \<emph\>Labels\</emph\> dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\labels.xhp	0	help	par_id3149233				0	is	On the \<emph\>Labels\</emph\> tab, under \<emph\>Format\</emph\>, define the label format.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\labels.xhp	0	help	par_id3145674				0	is	$[officename] Writer contains many formats of commercially available sheets for labels, badges, and business cards. You can also add other, user-defined formats.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\labels.xhp	0	help	par_id3143271				0	is	On the \<emph\>Labels\</emph\> tab, under \<emph\>Inscription\</emph\>, you can choose what you want written on the labels.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\labels.xhp	0	help	par_id3145610				0	is	This often involves database fields, so that the labels can be printed with varying content, when sending "Form Letters" for example. It is also possible to have the same text printed on every label.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\labels.xhp	0	help	par_id3151385	85			0	is	Use the \<emph\>Database \</emph\>and \<emph\>Table \</emph\>list boxes to select the database and table from which the data fields are obtained. Click on the arrow button to transfer the selected data field into the inscription area. Press Enter to insert a line break. You can also enter spaces and any other fixed text.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\labels.xhp	0	help	par_id3147560				0	is	On the \<emph\>Format\</emph\> tab you can define your own label formats, not covered by the predefined formats. To do this, select "User" from the \<emph\>Type\</emph\> list box. On the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> tab, you can specify whether all labels or only certain ones are to be created.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\labels.xhp	0	help	par_id3150358				0	is	On the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> tab page, make sure that the \<emph\>Synchronize contents\</emph\> box is selected. If this is selected, a label only has to be entered (on the top left label) and edited once.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\labels.xhp	0	help	par_id3156424				0	is	As soon as you click on \<emph\>New Document\</emph\>, you will see a small window with the \<emph\>Synchronize Labels\</emph\> button. Enter the first label. When you click on the \<emph\>Synchronize Labels\</emph\> button, the current individual label is copied to all the other labels on the sheet.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\labels.xhp	0	help	par_id3149767				0	is	Click on \<emph\>New Document\</emph\> to create a new document with the settings you have entered.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\labels.xhp	0	help	par_id3150449				0	is	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/01010300.xhp\" name=\"Nafnspjöld\"\>Nafnspjöld\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
