helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\numbering_stop.xhp	0	help	par_id0202200910470118				0	is	Bullets and Numbering of paragraphs is supported only in Writer, Impress and Draw.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\numbering_stop.xhp	0	help	par_id3154288				0	is	\<image id=\"img_id3153527\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_removebullets.png\" width=\"0.222in\" height=\"0.222in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153527\"\>Táknmynd\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\numbering_stop.xhp	0	help	par_id3150443				0	is	\<image id=\"img_id3163802\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_defaultbullet.png\" width=\"0.222in\" height=\"0.222in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3163802\"\>Táknmynd\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\numbering_stop.xhp	0	help	par_id3147618				0	is	For the current paragraph or selected paragraphs you can switch off the automatic numbering or listing. Click the \<emph\>Numbering Off\</emph\> icon in the \<emph\>Bullets and Numbering\</emph\> bar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\numbering_stop.xhp	0	help	par_id3155449				0	is	\<image id=\"img_id3158432\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_defaultbullet.png\" width=\"0.222in\" height=\"0.222in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3158432\"\>Táknmynd\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\numbering_stop.xhp	0	help	par_id3144511	31			0	is	If the cursor is located within a numbered or bulleted list, you can turn off automatic numbers or bullets for the current paragraph or selected paragraphs by clicking the \<emph\>Bullets On/Off \</emph\>icon on the \<emph\>Text Formatting\</emph\> bar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\numbering_stop.xhp	0	help	par_id3148946	12			0	is	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>To remove numbering from a paragraph using the keyboard: \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\numbering_stop.xhp	0	help	par_id3148663	13			0	is	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>Place the cursor at the beginning of a numbered paragraph and press the Backspace key. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\numbering_stop.xhp	0	help	par_id3150543	14			0	is	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>The numbering of the paragraph disappears and is removed from the numbering sequence. Numbering resumes in the following paragraph. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\numbering_stop.xhp	0	help	par_id3154123	15			0	is	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>If you press the Enter key in an empty numbered paragraph, the numbering stops. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20181231 09:50:43
