helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10655				0	is	You can use the Format Paintbrush tool to copy formatting from a text selection or from an object and apply the formatting to another text selection or object.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_id101920091122570				0	is	In Calc, the Format Paintbrush only applies to cell formatting.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DD				0	is	Select the text or object whose formatting you want to copy.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10667				0	is	On the \<emph\>Standard Bar\</emph\>, click the \<emph\>Format Paintbrush\</emph\> icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10660				0	is	The cursor changes to a paint bucket.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10663				0	is	If you want to apply the formatting to more than one selection, double-click the \<emph\>Format Paintbrush\</emph\> icon\<image id=\"img_id209967\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_formatpaintbrush.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id209967\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>. After you apply all the formatting, click the icon again.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN1066E				0	is	Select or click the text or object that you want to apply the formatting to.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10716				0	is	To exclude paragraph formatting, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> when you click. To exclude character formatting, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift when you click.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10671				0	is	The following table describes the formatting attributes that the \<emph\>Format Paintbrush\</emph\> can copy:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN10691				0	is	Type of Selection				20181231 09:50:43
