helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN1069E				0	is	Nothing selected, but cursor is inside a text passage				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\paintbrush.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A4				0	is	Copies the formatting of the current paragraph and the character formatting of the next character in the text flow direction.				20181231 09:50:43
