helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\active_help_on_off.xhp	0	help	par_id3157958				0	is	\<emph\>Extended tips\</emph\> provide a brief description of the function of a particular icon, text box or menu command when you rest your cursor on that item.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\active_help_on_off.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155339				0	is	To turn Extended Tips on and off:				20181231 09:50:43
