helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id7919248				0	is	Dictionaries are supplied and installed as extensions. Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Language - More Dictionaries Online\</item\> to open the dictionaries page in your default web browser.				20181231 09:50:43
