helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\language_select.xhp	0	help	par_id2897427				0	is	In the next page, click the Get It icon to download the dictionary extension. Note the folder name to which your browser downloads the file. Download additional dictionaries as you like.				20181231 09:50:43
