helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_doccompare.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154788				0	is	\<variable id=\"redlining_doccompare\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/redlining_doccompare.xhp\" name=\"Comparing Versions of a Document\"\>Comparing Versions of a Document\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_doccompare.xhp	0	help	par_id4186223				0	is	The review function is available in %PRODUCTNAME for text documents and spreadsheet documents.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_doccompare.xhp	0	help	par_id3995178				0	is	Imagine you have some co-authors or reviewers who collaborate with you writing your original document. One day you send out copies of your document to all reviewers. You ask them to edit the copy and send it back.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_doccompare.xhp	0	help	par_id9948423				0	is	Normally, the reviewers enable change tracking by \<emph\>Edit - Changes - Record\</emph\> and you can easily see the changes.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_doccompare.xhp	0	help	par_id3155421				0	is	If one of the authors has made changes to a document without recording them, you can compare the changed document to your original document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_doccompare.xhp	0	help	par_id3153087				0	is	Open the reviewer's document and then choose \<emph\>Edit - Compare Document\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_doccompare.xhp	0	help	par_id4208807				0	is	You should always start with opening the newer document and compare it with the older document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_doccompare.xhp	0	help	par_id3145315				0	is	A file selection dialog appears. Select your older original document and confirm the dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_doccompare.xhp	0	help	par_id3149762				0	is	\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> combines both documents into the reviewer's document. All text passages that occur in the reviewer's document but not in the original are identified as having been inserted, and all text passages that got deleted by the reviewer are identified as deletions.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\redlining_doccompare.xhp	0	help	par_id3145674				0	is	You can now accept or reject the insertions and deletions. At the end you may save the reviewer's document as a new original with a new name.				20181231 09:50:43
