helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\breaking_lines.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E3				0	is	This will work only with the text edit cursor inside the cell, not at the input line. So first double-click the cell, then single-click at the text position where you want the line break.				20181231 09:50:43
