helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_open.xhp	0	help	par_id3149164				0	is	Select the file you want to open and click \<emph\>Open\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_open.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149234				0	is	Restrict Files to Display				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_open.xhp	0	help	par_id3150985				0	is	To restrict the display of files in the \<emph\>Open\</emph\> dialog to a certain type select the corresponding \<emph\>File type\</emph\> from the list. Select \<emph\>All Files (*.*)\</emph\> to display all files.				20181231 09:50:43
