helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_open.xhp	0	help	par_id5509201				0	is	In general, all documents open with the cursor at the start of the document. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_open.xhp	0	help	par_id6594744				0	is	One exception appears when the author of a Writer text document saves and reopens a document: The cursor will be at the same position where it has been when the document was saved. This only works when the name of the author was entered in \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - User Data\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\doc_open.xhp	0	help	par_id3422650				0	is	Press Shift+F5 to set the cursor to the last saved position.				20181231 09:50:43
