helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id5374614				0	is	User A opens, edits, and saves the document as described above for Writer, Impress, and Draw document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id768761				0	is	The user wants to share the document for collaboration.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id6844691				0	is	The user chooses \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Share Document\</item\> to activate the collaboration features for this document. A dialog opens where the user can choose to enable or disable sharing. If the user enables sharing, the document will be saved in shared mode, which is also shown on the title bar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id5288857				0	is	The \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Share Document\</item\> command can be used to switch the mode for the current document from unshared mode to shared mode. If you want to use a shared document in unshared mode, you would save the shared document using another name or path. This creates a copy of the spreadsheet that is not shared.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	hd_id8842127				0	is	Opening a spreadsheet				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id7276528				0	is	User A opens a spreadsheet document. The following conditions can apply:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id8363902				0	is	The spreadsheet document is not in shared mode.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id5974303				0	is	The user can open, edit, and save the document as described above for Writer, Impress, and Draw documents.				20181231 09:50:43
