helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	hd_id2934965				0	is	Saving a shared spreadsheet document				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id1174657				0	is	User A saves a shared document. The following conditions can apply:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id2577593				0	is	The document was not modified and saved by another user since user A opened the document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id5883968				0	is	The document is saved.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id9049653				0	is	The document was modified and saved by another user since user A opened the document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id1976683				0	is	If the changes do not conflict, the document is saved.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id43946				0	is	If the changes conflict, the Resolve Conflicts dialog will be shown. User A must decide for the conflicts which version to keep, "Keep Mine" or "Keep Other". When all conflicts are resolved, the document is saved. While user A resolves the conflicts, no other user is able to save the shared document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id6449171				0	is	Another user tries to save the shared document and resolves conflicts in this moment.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id7101046				0	is	User A sees a message that a merge-in is in progress. User A can choose to cancel the save command for now, or retry saving some time later.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id7186498				0	is	When a user successfully saves a shared spreadsheet, the document will be reloaded after the save command, so that the spreadsheet shows the latest version of all changes that got saved by all users. A message shows that "foreign changes have been added" when another user did change some contents.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	hd_id2871791				0	is	Collaboration in Writer, Impress, and Draw				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id2675862				0	is	For all modules Writer, Impress, Draw, and for Calc when document sharing is not enabled, a file locking is possible. This file locking is available even when accessing the same document from different operating systems:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id7333597				0	is	User A opens a document. The following conditions can apply:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id9976195				0	is	The document is not locked by any other user.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id2507400				0	is	This document will be opened for read and write access by user A. The document will be locked for other users until user A closes the document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id216681				0	is	The document is marked as "read-only" by the file system.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id7709585				0	is	This document will be opened in read-only mode. Editing is not allowed. User A can save the document using another document name or another path. User A can edit this copy.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id4309518				0	is	The document is locked by another user.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id206610				0	is	User A sees a dialog that tells the user the document is locked. The dialog offers to open the document in read-only mode, or to open a copy for editing, or to cancel the Open command.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	hd_id29349651				0	is	User access permissions and sharing documents				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id11746571				0	is	Some conditions must be met on operating systems with a user permission management.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id25775931				0	is	The shared file needs to reside in a location which is accessible by all collaborators.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id90496531				0	is	The file permissions for both the document and the corresponding lock file need to be set so that all collaborators can create, delete, and change the files.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\collab.xhp	0	help	par_id71864981				0	is	Write access also enables other users to (accidentally or deliberately) delete or change a file.				20181231 09:50:43
