helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3150771				0	is	Click the Start button on the Windows taskbar. Choose \<emph\>Control Panel\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E8				0	is	In the Control Panel, click \<emph\>Add or Remove Programs\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
