helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3149669				0	is	In Internet Explorer, browse to a web page that contains a link to a $[officename] Writer document, for example.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3148550				0	is	Click the link to view the document in the Internet Explorer window.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3154072				0	is	You may still right-click the link to save the file on your harddisk.				20181231 09:50:43
