helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id4124881				0	is	When you \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>-click a hyperlink in a Writer document, your web browser opens with the requested web address. If you don't use a mouse, position the cursor inside the hyperlink and open the context menu by Shift+F10, then choose Open Hyperlink.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145071				0	is	Change the text of a hyperlink as follows				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410	12			0	is	In Writer documents, you can click anywhere into a hyperlink and edit the visible text. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id2690511				0	is	If you leave the hyperlink by positioning the cursor somewhere else, only the visible text will be changed.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id1983092				0	is	If you leave the hyperlink by entering a space character directly following the last character, the AutoCorrect - if enabled - will change the target URL to be the same as the visible text.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id333262				0	is	In all document types, you can open the Hyperlink dialog to edit a hyperlink. First set the cursor into the hyperlink or directly in front of the hyperlink, then click the Hyperlink icon on the Standard bar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	hd_id3158432				0	is	Change the URL of a hyperlink as follows				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3150503				0	is	Option 1: As described above, open \<link href=\"text/shared/02/09070000.xhp\" name=\"Hyperlink Dialog\"\>Hyperlink Dialog\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3145119				0	is	Option 2: Open \<link href=\"text/shared/main0209.xhp\" name=\"Hyperlink Bar\"\>Hyperlink Bar\</link\> (\<emph\>View - Toolbars - Hyperlink Bar\</emph\>). Click on the hyperlink, do not release the mouse button and drag the hyperlink to the Hyperlink Bar. Edit the URL on the Hyperlink Bar and press the Return key.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148686				0	is	Change the attribute of all hyperlinks				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3148943				0	is	Open the Styles and Formatting window.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	par_idN10826				0	is	Click the Character Styles icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	par_idN1082C				0	is	Right-click the "Internet Link" or "Visited Internet Link" character style, and choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	par_idN10834				0	is	In the dialog, select the new attributes, and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147530				0	is	Edit a hyperlink button				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\hyperlink_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3152361				0	is	If the hyperlink is a button, click on the border to select it, or press the \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> key while clicking. Open the \<emph\>Properties\</emph\> dialog through the context menu. You can edit the label text under "Caption," and modify the address in the "URL" field.				20181231 09:50:43
