helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\copy_drawfunctions.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147573				0	is	Inserting into a text document				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\copy_drawfunctions.xhp	0	help	par_id3150276				0	is	An inserted drawing object is anchored to the current paragraph. You can change the anchor by selecting the object and clicking the \<emph\>Change Anchor\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>OLE-Object\</emph\> toolbar or the \<emph\>Frame\</emph\> toolbar. This opens a popup menu where you can select the anchor type.				20181231 09:50:43
