helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_legend.xhp	0	help	par_id3154824				0	is	A gray border appears around the chart and the menu bar now contains commands for editing the objects in the chart.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_legend.xhp	0	help	par_id3153031				0	is	Choose \<emph\>Format - Legend\</emph\> or double-click on the legend. This opens the \<emph\>Legend\</emph\> dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_legend.xhp	0	help	par_id3147210				0	is	Choose from the available tabs to make modifications, then click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_legend.xhp	0	help	par_id3145674				0	is	To select the legend, first double-click on the chart (see step 1), then click on the legend. You can now move the legend within the chart using the mouse.				20181231 09:50:43
