helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id7211218				0	is	Click the \<emph\>Insert Chart\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> toolbar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\chart_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id7549363				0	is	You see a chart preview and the Chart Wizard.				20181231 09:50:43
