helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_id3149346				0	is	Extended tips provide a brief description about buttons and commands. To display an extended tip, press Shift+F1, then point to a button or command.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000120.xhp	0	help	par_idN10666				0	is	If you always want extended tips instead of tips, enable the extended tips on \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Tools - Options\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>\<emph\> - %PRODUCTNAME - General\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
