helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3155934				0	is	You can search for a specific topic by typing a word into the \<emph\>Search term\</emph\> text box. The window contains an alphabetical list of index terms.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\05\00000130.xhp	0	help	par_id3145669				0	is	If the cursor is in the index list when you type the search term, the display will jump directly to the next match. When you type a word in the \<emph\>Search term\</emph\> text box, the focus will jump to the best match in the index list.				20181231 09:50:43
