helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200312315378				0	is	The Improvement Program records some user interactions and sends them to the User Experience project.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903594966				0	is	The Improvement Program was initiated by the User Experience project to improve the usability of %PRODUCTNAME. The User Experience project can be found at the Apache OpenOffice website: \<link href=\"https://ux.openoffice.org/\"\>ux.openoffice.org/\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903594946				0	is	The second time you start your new %PRODUCTNAME software, you see a window that gives information about the Improvement Program. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200904094345				0	is	At this time you can choose to accept or deny your participation.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id052620090409438				0	is	If you accept, data recording starts immediately. When you start a new session of %PRODUCTNAME, the collected data will be sent. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200904094433				0	is	If you deny to participate, no data will be sent and recording of data stops immediately.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903594945				0	is	At any time, you can enable or disable the recording of user interaction data and the sending of these data. Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - Improvement Program\</item\>. Click the \<emph\>Info\</emph\> icon to browse to a web page with more information.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903594944				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click \<emph\>Yes, I am willing to participate …\</emph\> to enable the automatic feedback.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595080				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click \<emph\>No, I do not wish to participate\</emph\> to disable the automatic feedback.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
