helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070300.xhp	0	help	par_id3154942	24			0	is	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_GRID_CBX_BIGORTHO\"\>Specifies that a square is created based on the longer side of a rectangle when the Shift key is pressed before you release the mouse button. This also applies to an ellipse (a circle will be created based on the longest diameter of the ellipse). When the\<emph\> Extend edges \</emph\>box is not marked, a square or a circle will be created based on the shorter side or diameter.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
