helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149999	17			0	is	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>To enable the replacement table, choose \<emph\>Tools - AutoCorrect Options\</emph\>, click the\<emph\> Options\</emph\> tab, and then select\<emph\> Use replacement table\</emph\>. To use the replacement table while you type, choose \<emph\>Format - AutoCorrect - While Typing\</emph\>. \</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20181231 09:50:43
