helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02220000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149751				0	is	You can draw three types of hotspots: rectangles, ellipses, and polygons. When you click a hotspot, the URL is opened in the browser window or frame that you specify. You can also specify the text that appears when your mouse rests on the hotspot.				20181231 09:50:43
