helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156293				0	is	If you opened the dialog by choosing \<emph\>Insert - File\</emph\>, the \<emph\>Open\</emph\> button is labeled \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>. \<ahelp hid=\"HID_FILEDLG_INSERT_BTN\"\>Inserts the selected file into the current document at the cursor position.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
