helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020300.xhp	0	help	par_id3150866	99			0	is	The format code for currencies uses the form [$xxx-nnn], where xxx is the currency symbol, and nnn the country code. Special banking symbols, such as EUR (for Euro), do not require the country code. The currency format is not dependent on the language that you select in the\<emph\> Language\</emph\> box. 				20181231 09:50:43
