helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912284853				0	is	The Print dialog consists of three main parts: A preview with navigation buttons, several tab pages with control elements specific to the current document type, and the Print, Cancel, and Help buttons. 				20181231 09:50:43
