helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\01130000.xhp	0	help	par_id0818200912284952				0	is	The settings that you define in the Print dialog are valid only for the current print job that you start by clicking the Print button. If you want to change some options permanently, open Tools - Options - %PRODUCTNAME (application name) - Print.				20181231 09:50:43
