helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151282	36			0	is	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Bib/Mapping\"\>Lets you map the column headings to data fields from a different data source. To define a different data source for your bibliography, click the\<emph\> Data Source\</emph\> button on the record\<emph\> Object Bar\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
