helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150961				0	is	Represents a space character (but not other whitespace characters).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150486				0	is	[:print:]				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3150872				0	is	Represents a printable character.				20181231 09:50:43
