helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3152576				0	is	Represents a nonprinting character.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3149958				0	is	[:lower:]				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id3145730				0	is	Represents a lowercase character if \<emph\>Match case\</emph\> is selected in \<emph\>Options\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
