helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id4721823				0	is	{3} means there must be exactly 3 copies of "digit", 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02100001.xhp	0	help	par_id5806756				0	is	$ means the match must end a paragraph. 				20181231 09:50:43
