helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109C1				0	is	The rules can be condensed to the statement that the stronger attribute wins. If, for example, one cell has a red border of 2 point width, and the adjacent cell has a blue border of 3 point width, then the common border between these two cells will be blue with 3 point width.				20181231 09:50:43
