helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152909				0	is	To edit the individual objects of a group, select the group, right-click, and then choose \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"DRAW\"\>\<emph\>Enter Group\</emph\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<emph\>Group - Enter Group\</emph\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159158				0	is	When you are editing a group, the objects that are not part of the group are faded.				20181231 09:50:43
