helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154682				0	is	\<variable id=\"recht\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Spelling\"\>Checks the document or the current selection for spelling errors. If a grammar checking extension is installed, the dialog also checks for grammar errors.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1064B				0	is	The spellcheck starts at the current cursor position and advances to the end of the document or selection. You can then choose to continue the spellcheck from the beginning of the document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3166445				0	is	Spellcheck looks for misspelled words and gives you the option of adding an unknown word to a user dictionary. When the first misspelled word is found, the \<emph\>Spellcheck\</emph\> dialog opens.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id1022200801300654				0	is	If a grammar checking extension is installed, this dialog is called \<emph\>Spelling and Grammar\</emph\>. Spelling errors are underlined in red, grammar errors in blue. First the dialog presents all spelling errors, then all grammar errors.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id1022200801354366				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Enable \<emph\>Check grammar\</emph\> to work first on all spellcheck errors, then on all grammar errors.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
