helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147045				0	is	Choose \<emph\>File - New - Database\</emph\> to open the Database Wizard.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147394				0	is	Click \<emph\>Connect to an existing database\</emph\>, and then select "Adabas" in the listbox (scroll up in the listbox).				20181231 09:50:43
