helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154585				0	is	Here you can enter one additional criterion for filtering in each line. Multiple criteria in one column will be connected by an OR link.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148800				0	is	You can also use the context menu of the line headers in the lower area of the query design to insert another line for functions:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148419				0	is	Bæta við				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153233	152			0	is	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_QRYDGN_ROW_FUNCTION\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Select a function to run in the query here.\</ahelp\> The functions you can run here depend on the database. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id8760818				0	is	If you are working with the HSQL database, the list box in the \<emph\>Function\</emph\> row offers you the following options:				20181231 09:50:43
