helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3157998				0	is	\<emph\>Date fields\</emph\> are represented as #Date# to clearly identify them as dates. Date, time and date/time constants (literals) used in conditions can be of either the SQL Escape Syntax type, or default SQL2 syntax.				20181231 09:50:43
