helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_main.xhp	0	help	par_id7599108				0	is	If you like to sort and group, open the Report Builder view, then open the Sorting and Grouping dialog. Select to show a Group Header for the fields that you want to group, and select to hide the Group Header for the fields that you want to be sorted. Close the Sorting and Grouping window and execute the report.				20181231 09:50:43
