helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149064				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_SYSDEVSPACE\"\>Enter the path for the system DEVSPACE.\</ahelp\> The SYSDEVSPACE manages the configuration data for the database. The size of the SYSDEVSPACE depends on the size of the database.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147319				0	is	TRANSACTIONLOG				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154190				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_TRANSACTIONLOG\"\>Enter the path for the transaction log file.\</ahelp\> This file records all modifications that are made to the database during a transaction, and overwrites them when the transaction is completed. The TRANSACTIONLOG is also used for the rollback of a transaction.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145748				0	is	DATADEVSPACE				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152597				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DLG_ADABAS_DATADEVSPACE\"\>Enter the path for the data DEVSPACE.\</ahelp\> This file stores user data, such as tables and indexes, as well as the SQL catalog (schema info). The data contained in one user table is evenly distributed across all DATADEVSPACEs. The combined size of all DATADEVSPACEs corresponds to the size of the database.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150103				0	is	The maximum size for a DATADEVSPACE in the limited version Adabas database is 100MB.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147426				0	is	If the DATADEVSPACE reaches full capacity during a database operation, Adabas shuts down, increases the capacity of the DATADEVSPACE (up to 100 MB), and restarts the database. Saved data is not lost.				20181231 09:50:43
