helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\main.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147341				0	is	\<variable id=\"main\"\>\<link href=\"text/smath/guide/main.xhp\" name=\"Leiðbeiningar fyrir notkun $[officename] Math\"\>Leiðbeiningar fyrir notkun $[officename] Math\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
