helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090904.xhp	0	help	par_id3146965				0	is	func G^{(%alpha" ," %beta)}_{ x_m x_n} = left[ matrix { arctan(%alpha) # arctan(%beta) ## x_m + x_n # x_m - x_n }right]				20181231 09:50:43
