helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090600.xhp	0	help	par_idN100D5				0	is	\<image id=\"img_id3154504\" src=\"starmath/res/at21702.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154504\"\>Táknmynd\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
