helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090600.xhp	0	help	par_id3150018				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_GRAVEX\"\>Inserts a placeholder with a \<emph\>grave accent\</emph\> (grave).\</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\>grave <?>\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090600.xhp	0	help	par_idN10115				0	is	\<image id=\"img_id3155370\" src=\"starmath/res/at21703.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3155370\"\>Táknmynd\</alt\>\</image\>				20181231 09:50:43
