helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146968				0	is	Grunnstærð				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145115				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH:METRICFIELD:RID_FONTSIZEDIALOG:1\"\>All elements of a formula are proportionally scaled to the base size. To change the base size, select or type in the desired point (pt) size. You can also use other units of measure or other \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000001.xhp#metrik\" name=\"metrics\"\>metrics\</link\>, which are then automatically converted to points.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153005				0	is	To permanently change the default size (12 pt) used in $[officename] Math, you must first set the size (for example, 11 pt) and then click the \<emph\>Default\</emph\> button.				20181231 09:50:43
