helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020101.xhp	0	help	par_id3125864				0	is	Modifies the alignment of the chart title.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020101.xhp	0	help	par_id3145748				0	is	Some of the options are not available for all types of labels. For example, there are different options for 2D and 3D object labels.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150717				0	is	Please note that problems may arise in displaying labels if the size of your chart is too small. You can avoid this by either enlarging the view or decreasing the font size.				20181231 09:50:43
