helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152872				0	is	Röð				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05020201.xhp	0	help	par_id3159230				0	is	The options on this tab are only available for a 2D chart, under \<emph\>Format - Axis - Y Axis\</emph\> or \<emph\>X Axis\</emph\>. In this area, you can define the alignment of the number labels on the X or Y axis.				20181231 09:50:43
