helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id3614917				0	is	If you enter text for a title, subtitle, or any axis, the necessary space will be reserved to display the text next to the chart. If you do not enter a text, no space will be reserved, leaving more space to display the chart.				20181231 09:50:43
