helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152577				0	is	This dialog allows you to change the properties of a selected data point. The dialog appears when there is only one data point selected when you choose \<emph\>Format - Format Selection\</emph\>. Some of the menu entries are only available for 2D or 3D charts.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149121				0	is	Any changes made only affect this one data point. For example, if you edit the color of a bar, only the color of that bar will be different.				20181231 09:50:43
