helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3166428				0	is	Use this area to assign a second axis to your chart. If a data series is already assigned to this axis, $[officename] automatically displays the axis and the label. You can turn off these settings later on. If no data has been assigned to this axis and you activate this area, the values of the primary Y axis are applied to the secondary axis.				20181231 09:50:43
