helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148488				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ConnectorToolbox\"\>Open the \<emph\>Connectors\</emph\> toolbar, where you can add connectors to objects in the current slide. A connector is a line that joins objects, and remains attached when the objects are moved. If you copy an object with a connector, the connector is also copied.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154658				0	is	There are four types of connector lines:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145584				0	is	Standard (90-degree angle bends)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154485				0	is	Line (two bends)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153817				0	is	Beint				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149943				0	is	Boglína				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148604				0	is	When you click a connector and move your mouse pointer over a filled object, or the edge of an unfilled object, gluepoints appear. A gluepoint is a fixed point where you can attach a connector line. You can add custom \<link href=\"text/simpress/02/10030200.xhp\" name=\"glue point\"\>gluepoints\</link\> to an object.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154762				0	is	To draw a connector line, click a gluepoint on an object, drag to a gluepoint on another object, and then release. You can also drag to an empty part of you document and click. The unattached end of the connector is locked in place, until you drag the end to a different location. To detach a connector, drag either end of the connector line to a different location.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147297				0	is	Tengilína				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10100000.xhp	0	help	par_id3166468				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Connector\"\>Draws a connector with one or more 90-degree angle bends. Click a gluepoint on an object, drag to a gluepoint on another object, and then release.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
