helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\show.xhp	0	help	par_id9636829				0	is	Different ways exist to start a slide show. Once a slide show is running, you can take control pressing keys or clicking the mouse buttons.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\show.xhp	0	help	par_id7076937				0	is	By default, a slide show always starts with the first slide. You advance manually through slides up to the last slide. You can change these settings.				20181231 09:50:43
