helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\show.xhp	0	help	par_id3741264				0	is	Many more keys are available to \<link href=\"text/simpress/04/01020000.xhp\"\>control a slide show\</link\>. You can also right-click to open a context menu with useful commands.				20181231 09:50:43
