helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\show.xhp	0	help	par_id9766533				0	is	Smella á \<emph\>Nota á allar skyggnur\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\show.xhp	0	help	par_id6081728				0	is	You can assign a different time for every slide to advance to the next slide. The \<link href=\"text/simpress/guide/rehearse_timings.xhp\"\>rehearse timings\</link\> feature can assist you to get the timing right.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\show.xhp	0	help	par_id9219641				0	is	To advance to the first slide, after all slides have been shown, you must set the slide show to repeat automatically.				20181231 09:50:43
