helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\gluepoints.xhp	0	help	par_id0919200803041082				0	is	Click the \<emph\>Glue Point\</emph\> icon on the Drawing toolbar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\gluepoints.xhp	0	help	par_id0919200803041186				0	is	Veldu \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Breyta - Festipunktar\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\gluepoints.xhp	0	help	par_id0919200803041160				0	is	Click the \<emph\>Insert Glue Point\</emph\> icon on the Gluepoints toolbar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\gluepoints.xhp	0	help	par_id0919200803041115				0	is	Click inside the shape where you want to add the new gluepoint.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\gluepoints.xhp	0	help	par_id0919200803041133				0	is	If the shape is filled, you can click anywhere inside the shape. If the shape is unfilled, you can click the border to insert a glue point. Once inserted, you can drag the glue point to another position inside the shape.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\gluepoints.xhp	0	help	par_id0919200803041250				0	is	With the four icons next to the \<emph\>Insert Glue Point\</emph\> icon, you choose the directions which will be permitted for a connector at this gluepoint. You can choose one or more directions for a particular gluepoint.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\gluepoints.xhp	0	help	par_id0919200803041298				0	is	If the \<emph\>Glue Point Relative\</emph\> icon is active, the gluepoint moves when you resize the object to keep its position relative to the object borders.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\gluepoints.xhp	0	help	par_id0919200803041223				0	is	If the \<emph\>Glue Point Relative\</emph\> icon is not active, the icons next to it are no longer grayed out. With these icons you can decide where a gluepoint will be placed when the size of the object is changed.				20181231 09:50:43
