helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rename_table.xhp	0	help	par_id0909200810502833				0	is	Sheet names can contain almost any character. Some naming restrictions apply when you want to save the spreadsheet to Microsoft Excel format.				20181231 09:50:43
