helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rounding_numbers.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153361				0	is	\<bookmark_value\>numbers; rounded off\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>rounded off numbers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>exact numbers in $[officename] Calc\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>decimal places; showing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>changing;number of decimal places\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>values;rounded in calculations\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>calculating;rounded off values\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>numbers; decimal places\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>precision as shown\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>rounding precision\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>spreadsheets; values as shown\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rounding_numbers.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156422				0	is	\<variable id=\"rounding_numbers\"\>\<link href=\"text/scalc/guide/rounding_numbers.xhp\" name=\"Using Rounded Off Numbers\"\>Using Rounded Off Numbers\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rounding_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3153726				0	is	In $[officename] Calc, all decimal numbers are displayed rounded off to two decimal places.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rounding_numbers.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152596				0	is	To change this for selected cells				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rounding_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3154321				0	is	Mark all the cells you want to modify.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rounding_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3147428				0	is	Choose \<emph\>Format - Cells\</emph\> and go to the \<emph\>Numbers\</emph\> tab page.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rounding_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3153876				0	is	In the \<emph\>Category\</emph\> field, select \<emph\>Number\</emph\>. Under \<emph\>Options\</emph\>, change the number of \<emph\>Decimal places\</emph\> and exit the dialog with OK.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rounding_numbers.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155415				0	is	To change this everywhere				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rounding_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3150715				0	is	Choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Calc\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rounding_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3153707				0	is	Go to the \<emph\>Calculate\</emph\> page. Modify the number of \<emph\>Decimal places\</emph\> and exit the dialog with OK.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rounding_numbers.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154755				0	is	To calculate with the rounded off numbers instead of the internal exact values				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rounding_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3150045				0	is	Choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Calc\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\rounding_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3146920				0	is	Go to the \<emph\>Calculate\</emph\> page. Mark the \<emph\>Precision as shown\</emph\> field and exit the dialog with OK.				20181231 09:50:43
