helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_workday.xhp	0	help	par_id3147469				0	is	\<emph\>StartDate\</emph\> is the date from when the calculation is carried out. If the start date is a workday, the day is included in the calculation.				20181231 09:50:43
