helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_workday.xhp	0	help	par_id3152782				0	is	What date came 17 workdays after 1 December 2001? Enter the start date "2001-12-01" in C3 and the number of workdays in D3. Cells F3 to J3 contain the following Christmas and New Year holidays: "2001-12-24", "2001-12-25", "2001-12-26", "2001-12-31", "2002-01-01".				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_workday.xhp	0	help	par_id3146142				0	is	=WORKDAY(C3;D3;F3:J3) returns 2001-12-28. Format the serial date number as a date, for example in the format YYYY-MM-DD.				20181231 09:50:43
