helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3153551				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_DATUM\"\>This function calculates a date specified by year, month, day and displays it in the cell's formatting.\</ahelp\> The default format of a cell containing the DATE function is the date format, but you can format the cells with any other number format.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_date.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148590				0	is	Notkun				20181231 09:50:43
