helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154758				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Calculate\"\>Recalculates all changed formulas. If AutoCalculate is enabled, the Recalculate command applies only to formulas like RAND or NOW.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id315475899				0	is	Press F9 to recalculate. Press Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F9 to recalculate all formulas in the document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150793				0	is	After the document has been recalculated, the display is refreshed. All charts are also refreshed.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06080000.xhp	0	help	par_id315475855				0	is	The Add-In functions like RANDBETWEEN currently cannot respond to the Recalculate command or F9. Press Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F9 to recalculate all formulas, including the Add-In functions.				20181231 09:50:43
