helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3151052				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_CHITEST\"\>Returns the probability of a deviance from a random distribution of two test series based on the chi-squared test for independence.\</ahelp\> CHITEST returns the chi-squared distribution of the data.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3148925				0	is	The probability determined by CHITEST can also be determined with CHIDIST, in which case the Chi square of the random sample must then be passed as a parameter instead of the data row.				20181231 09:50:43
