helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_eastersunday.xhp	0	help	par_id3938413				0	is	\<emph\>Year\</emph\> is an integer between 1583 and 9956 or 0 and 99. You can also calculate other holidays by simple addition with this date.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_eastersunday.xhp	0	help	par_id3156156				0	is	Easter Monday = EASTERSUNDAY(Year) + 1				20181231 09:50:43
