helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149350				0	is	If you start the \<emph\>Function Wizard\</emph\> while the cell cursor is positioned in a cell that already contains a function, the \<emph\>Structure\</emph\> tab is opened and shows the composition of the current formula.				20181231 09:50:43
