helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3151241				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_MEDIAN\"\>Returns the median of a set of numbers. In a set containing an uneven number of values, the median will be the number in the middle of the set and in a set containing an even number of values, it will be the mean of the two values in the middle of the set.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
