helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060184.xhp	0	help	par_id3154940				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_QUANTIL\"\>Returns the alpha-percentile of data values in an array.\</ahelp\> A percentile returns the scale value for a data series which goes from the smallest (Alpha=0) to the largest value (alpha=1) of a data series. For \<item type=\"literal\"\>Alpha\</item\> = 25%, the percentile means the first quartile; \<item type=\"literal\"\>Alpha\</item\> = 50% is the MEDIAN.				20181231 09:50:43
