helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3159239				0	is	\<emph\>Date\</emph\> specifies whether a given date falls within a leap year. The Date parameter must be a valid date according to the locale settings of %PRODUCTNAME.				20181231 09:50:43
