helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153362	2			0	is	The\<emph\> Protect Document \</emph\>command prevents changes from being made to cells in the sheets or to sheets in a document. As an option, you can define a password. If a password is defined, removal of the protection is only possible if the user enters the correct password.				20181231 09:50:43
