helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_weeknum.xhp	0	help	par_id3147511				0	is	\<emph\>Number\</emph\> is the internal date number.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_weeknum.xhp	0	help	par_id3154269				0	is	\<emph\>Mode\</emph\> sets the start of the week and the calculation type.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_weeknum.xhp	0	help	par_id3148930				0	is	1 = Sunnudagur				20181231 09:50:43
