helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060104.xhp	0	help	par_id8751792				0	is	The example returns 6. The formula is calculated from left to right as: 1 + 2 equals 3, giving the result to date when CURRENT() is encountered; CURRENT() therefore yields 3, which is added to the original 3 to give 6.				20181231 09:50:43
