helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155411	15			0	is	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SC_SCENWIN_BOTTOM\"\>Specifies additional information about the scenario. This information will be displayed in the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02110000.xhp\" name=\"Navigator\"\>Navigator\</link\> when you click the \<emph\>Scenarios\</emph\> icon and select the desired scenario.\</ahelp\> You can also modify this information in the Navigator through the \<emph\>Properties \</emph\>context menu command.				20181231 09:50:43
