helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\01120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145847				0	is	Use the icons on the \<emph\>Page Preview Bar\</emph\> to scroll through the pages of the document or to print the document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\01120000.xhp	0	help	par_id9838862				0	is	You can also press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Page Up and Ctrl+Page Down keys to scroll through the pages.				20181231 09:50:43
