helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060107.xhp	0	help	par_id3154121				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_EINHEITSMATRIX\"\>Returns the unitary square array of a certain size.\</ahelp\> The unitary array is a square array where the main diagonal elements equal 1 and all other array elements are equal to 0.				20181231 09:50:43
