helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150793				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AutoComplete\"\>Switches the AutoInput function on and off, which automatically completes entries, based on other entries in the same column.\</ahelp\> The column is scanned up to a maximum of 2000 cells or 200 different strings.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156422				0	is	The completion text is highlighted.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06130000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1065D				0	is	To accept the completion, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Enter\</item\> or a cursor key.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06130000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10665				0	is	To append text or to edit the completion, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>F2\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06130000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1066D				0	is	To view more completions, press \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Tab\</item\> to scroll forward, or \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Shift+Tab\</item\> to scroll backward.				20181231 09:50:43
