helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150439				0	is	When typing formulas using characters that match previous entries, a Help tip will appear listing the last ten functions used from \<emph\>Function Wizard\</emph\>, from all defined range names, from all database range names, and from the content of all label ranges.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06130000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153363				0	is	AutoInput is case-sensitive. If, for example, you have written "Total" in a cell, you cannot enter "total" in another cell of the same column without first deactivating AutoInput.				20181231 09:50:43
