helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06030700.xhp	0	help	par_id3151211				0	is	The \<emph\>Fill Mode\</emph\> function is identical to the \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/06030100.xhp\" name=\"Trace Precedent\"\>Trace Precedent\</link\> command if you call this mode for the first time. Use the context menu to select further options for the Fill Mode and to exit this mode.				20181231 09:50:43
