helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150284				0	is	\<bookmark_value\>COMBINA function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>number of combinations with repetitions\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
