helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3150796				0	is	Returns \<emph\>Number\</emph\> with at most \<emph\>Count\</emph\> decimal places. Excess decimal places are simply removed, irrespective of sign.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3150816				0	is	\<item type=\"literal\"\>TRUNC(Number; 0)\</item\> behaves as \<item type=\"literal\"\>INT(Number)\</item\> for positive numbers, but effectively rounds towards zero for negative numbers.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3148548				0	is	The \<emph\>visible\</emph\> decimal places of the result are specified in \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01060500.xhp\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Calc - Calculate\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
