helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3155701				0	is	\<item type=\"input\"\>=MULTINOMIAL(F11:H11)\</item\> returns 1260, if F11 to H11 contain the values \<item type=\"input\"\>2\</item\>, \<item type=\"input\"\>3\</item\> and \<item type=\"input\"\>4\</item\>. This corresponds to the formula =(2+3+4)! / (2!*3!*4!)				20181231 09:50:43
