helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3159594				0	is	\<item type=\"input\"\>=POWER(4;3)\</item\> returns 64, which is 4 to the power of 3.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id1614429				0	is	=4^3 also returns 4 to the power of 3.				20181231 09:50:43
