helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3144344				0	is	\<emph\>N\</emph\> is the initial power				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3144357				0	is	\<emph\>M\</emph\> is the increment to increase N				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3144370				0	is	\<emph\>Coefficients\</emph\> is a series of coefficients. For each coefficient the series sum is extended by one section.				20181231 09:50:43
