helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3158321				0	is	 For integer arguments this function returns Dividend modulo Divisor, that is the remainder when \<emph\>Dividend\</emph\> is divided by \<emph\>Divisor\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3158341				0	is	This function is implemented as \<item type=\"literal\"\>Dividend - Divisor * INT(Dividend/Divisor)\</item\> , and this formula gives the result if the arguments are not integer.				20181231 09:50:43
