helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3163342				0	is	Returns \<emph\>Number\</emph\> rounded up (away from zero) to \<emph\>Count\</emph\> decimal places. If Count is omitted or zero, the function rounds up to an integer. If Count is negative, the function rounds up to the next 10, 100, 1000, etc.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id9573961				0	is	This function rounds away from zero. See ROUNDDOWN and ROUND for alternatives.				20181231 09:50:43
