helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id7700430				0	is	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ROUNDUP(1.2345;1)\</item\> skilar 1.3.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id1180455				0	is	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ROUNDUP(45.67;0)\</item\> skilar 46.				20181231 09:50:43
