helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3409527				0	is	\<item type=\"input\"\>=ROUNDUP(987.65;-2)\</item\> skilar 1000.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3144877				0	is	\<bookmark_value\>SIN fall\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
