helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3144937				0	is	SIN(Tala)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3144950				0	is	Returns the (trigonometric) sine of \<emph\>Number\</emph\>, the angle in radians.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id8079470				0	is	To return the sine of an angle in degrees, use the RADIANS function.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144969				0	is	Dæmi				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3144983				0	is	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SIN(PI()/2)\</item\> returns 1, the sine of PI/2 radians.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3916440				0	is	\<item type=\"input\"\>=SIN(RADIANS(30))\</item\> returns 0.5, the sine of 30 degrees.				20181231 09:50:43
