helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164288				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_MROUND\"\>Returns a number rounded to the nearest multiple of another number.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3164306				0	is	Notkun				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164320				0	is	MROUND(Number; Multiple)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3486434				0	is	Returns \<emph\>Number\</emph\> rounded to the nearest multiple of \<emph\>Multiple\</emph\>. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3068636				0	is	An alternative implementation would be \<item type=\"literal\"\>Multiple * ROUND(Number/Multiple)\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
