helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3164347				0	is	\<item type=\"input\"\>=MROUND(15.5;3)\</item\> returns 15, as 15.5 is closer to 15 (= 3*5) than to 18 (= 3*6).				20181231 09:50:43
