helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3164800				0	is	\<bookmark_value\>RAND function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>random numbers;between 0 and 1\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
