helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3147423	25			0	is	            \<emph\>Salvage\</emph\> is the value of an asset after depreciation.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3151229	26			0	is	            \<emph\>Life\</emph\> is the period fixing the time span over which an asset is depreciated.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3147473	27			0	is	            \<emph\>Period\</emph\> defines the period for which the depreciation is to be calculated.				20181231 09:50:43
