helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3145777	319			0	is	            \<emph\>Period\</emph\> is the number of installments for calculation of interest.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3153678	320			0	is	            \<emph\>TotalPeriods\</emph\> is the total number of installment periods.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3159390	321			0	is	            \<emph\>Invest\</emph\> is the amount of the investment.				20181231 09:50:43
