helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	par_id3159488				0	is	\<variable id=\"druckbereichetext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:EditPrintArea\"\>Opens a dialog where you can specify the print range.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> You can also set the rows or columns which are to be repeated in every page.				20181231 09:50:43
