helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05080300.xhp	0	help	par_id3155418				0	is	You can also define repeating rows by dragging the mouse in the spreadsheet, if the cursor is in the \<emph\>Rows to repeat\</emph\> text field in the dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
