helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footer_pagenumber.xhp	0	help	par_id3155532				0	is	Click in front of the page number field, type \<item type=\"literal\"\>Page\</item\> and enter a space; click after the field, enter a space and then type \<item type=\"literal\"\>of\</item\> and enter another space.				20181231 09:50:43
