helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146875				0	is	\<variable id=\"change_header\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/change_header.xhp\" name=\"Creating a Page Style Based on the Current Page\"\>Creating a Page Style Based on the Current Page\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3153584				0	is	You can design a page layout and then create a page style based on it.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3154245				0	is	For example, you can create a page style that displays a particular header, and another page style that displays a different header.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3150503				0	is	Open a new text document, choose \<emph\>Format - Styles and Formatting\</emph\>, and then click the \<emph\>Page Styles\</emph\> icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3150532				0	is	Click the \<emph\>New Style from Selection\</emph\> icon and select \<emph\>New Styles from Selection\</emph\> from the submenu.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3153153				0	is	Type a name for the page in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Style name\</item\> box, and then click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3153184	32			0	is	Double-click the name in the list to apply the style to the current page. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3155541				0	is	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Header\</emph\>, and choose the new page style from the list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3155572				0	is	Type the text that you want in the header. Position the cursor into the main text area outside of the header.				20181231 09:50:43
