helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3147771				0	is	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> area, select \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Page break\</item\> and then select “Default” from the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Style\</item\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\change_header.xhp	0	help	par_id3147810				0	is	Repeat steps 2-6 to create a second custom page style with a different header.				20181231 09:50:43
