helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159257				0	is	\<variable id=\"form_letters\"\>\<variable id=\"form_letters_main\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/form_letters_main.xhp\" name=\"Creating a Form Letter\"\>Creating a Form Letter\</link\>\</variable\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_id3150502				0	is	To create a form letter, you need a text document that contains fields for address data, and an address database. Then you combine or merge the address data and the text document to either print the letters or send them by e-mail.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_id0805200801132382				0	is	If the document is in HTML format, any embedded or linked images will not be sent with the e-mail.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_idN10653				0	is	The \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/mailmerge00.xhp\"\>Mail Merge Wizard\</link\> helps you to create form letters.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_idN10664				0	is	To create a form letter				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_idN1066B				0	is	Veldu \<emph\>Verkfæri - Leiðarvísir fyrir póstsameiningu\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_idN10672				0	is	You see the Mail Merge Wizard dialog. The following is an example of one of many possible ways to navigate the wizard's pages:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_idN10676				0	is	Select \<emph\>Start from a template\</emph\>, and click the \<emph\>Browse\</emph\> button.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_idN10681				0	is	You see the \<emph\>New\</emph\> dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_idN10685				0	is	Select \<item type=\"literal\"\>Business Correspondence\</item\> in the left list, and then \<item type=\"literal\"\>Modern letter\</item\> in the right list. Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to close the Templates dialog, and click \<emph\>Next\</emph\> in the wizard.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_id2669759				0	is	Select \<emph\>Letter\</emph\> and click \<emph\>Next\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_idN106BD				0	is	On the next step of the wizard, click the \<emph\>Select Address List\</emph\> button to check that you are using the correct address list. Select an address block type, match the data fields if necessary, and click \<emph\>Next\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_idN106C5				0	is	Next follows the \<emph\>Create a salutation\</emph\> step. Deselect the \<emph\>Insert personalized salutation\</emph\> box. Under \<emph\>General salutation\</emph\>, select the salutation that you want on top of all letters.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\form_letters_main.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D5				0	is	Click \<emph\>Next\</emph\> and finally \<emph\>Finish\</emph\> to create the mail merge.				20181231 09:50:43
