helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3147395				0	is	You can include chapter numbers in captions.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\captions_numbers.xhp	0	help	par_id3147408				0	is	Ensure that the text in your document is organized by chapters, and that the chapter titles and, if you want, the section titles, use one of the predefined heading paragraph styles. You must also assign a numbering option to the heading paragraph styles.				20181231 09:50:43
