helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\protection.xhp	0	help	par_id3145643				0	is	Place the cursor in a cell or select cells. Right-click to open the context menu, then choose \<emph\>Cell - Protect\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
