helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\word_completion_adjust.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B0E				0	is	The space character is appended after you type the first character of the next word after the auto-completed word. The space character is suppressed if the next character is a delimiter, such as a full stop or a new line character.				20181231 09:50:43
