helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3145808				0	is	If you want to increase the spacing between footnote or endnote texts, you can add a top and bottom border to the corresponding paragraph style.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3155603				0	is	Click in a footnote or endnote.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3155620				0	is	Veldu \<emph\>Sníða - Stílar og snið\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3154251				0	is	Right-click the Paragraph Style that you want to modify, for example, "Footnote", and choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3155884				0	is	Click the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030500.xhp\" name=\"Borders\"\>\<emph\>Borders\</emph\>\</link\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3147110				0	is	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Default\</item\> area, click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Set Top and Bottom Borders Only\</item\> icon.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3150931				0	is	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Line\</item\> area, click a line in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Style\</item\> list.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3150961				0	is	Select "White" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Color\</item\> box. If the background of the page is not white, select the color that best matches the background color.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3150519				0	is	In the \<emph\>Spacing to contents\</emph\> area, clear the \<emph\>Synchronize\</emph\> check box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3150709				0	is	Enter a value in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Top\</item\> and \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Bottom\</item\> boxes.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3150740				0	is	Smelltu á \<emph\>Í lagi\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\footnote_with_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3148846				0	is	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030500.xhp\" name=\"Sníða - Málsgrein - Spássíur\"\>Sníða - Málsgrein - Spássíur\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	tit				0	is	Indenting Paragraphs				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155869				0	is	\<bookmark_value\>formatting; indenting paragraphs\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>indents;in text\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>paragraphs; indents\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>hanging indents in paragraphs\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>right indents in paragraphs\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>lines of text; indents\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>changing;indents\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	hd_id129398				0	is	\<variable id=\"indenting\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/indenting.xhp\"\>Indenting Paragraphs\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id5589159				0	is	To change the measurement units, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - General\</item\>, and then select a new measurement unit in the Settings area. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id9936216				0	is	You can change the indents for the current paragraph, or for all selected paragraphs, or for a Paragraph Style.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id7953123				0	is	You can also \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/ruler.xhp\" name=\"ruler\"\>set indents using the ruler\</link\>. To display the ruler, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>View - Ruler\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id4013794				0	is	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Paragraph - Indents & Spacing\</item\> to change the indents for the current paragraph or for all selected paragraphs. You can also \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/ruler.xhp\" name=\"ruler\"\>set indents using the ruler\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id1631824				0	is	Right-click a paragraph and choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Edit Paragraph Style - Indents & Spacing\</item\> to change the indents for all paragraphs that have the same Paragraph Style.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id7271645				0	is	Indents are calculated with respect to the left and right page margins. If you want the paragraph to extend into the page margin, enter a negative number. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id2136295				0	is	The indents are different regarding the writing direction. For example, look at the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Before text \</item\>indent value in left-to-right languages. The left edge of the paragraph is indented with respect to the left page margin. In right-to-left languages, the right edge of the paragraph is indented with respect to the right page margin.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id4186223				0	is	For a hanging indent, enter a positive value for \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Before text\</item\> and a negative value for \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>First line\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\indenting.xhp	0	help	par_id1491134				0	is	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030100.xhp\"\>Format - Paragraph - Indents & Spacing\</link\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	tit				0	is	Finding and Replacing in Writer				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	bm_id1163670				0	is	\<bookmark_value\>finding; text/text formats/styles/objects\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>replacing; text and text formats\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>styles;finding\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>searching, see also finding\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>text formats; finding\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>formats; finding and replacing\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>searching; formats\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>objects;finding by Navigator\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>Asian languages;search options\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	hd_id8568681				0	is	\<variable id=\"finding\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/finding.xhp\"\>Finding and Replacing in Writer\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id611285				0	is	In text documents you can find words, formatting, styles, and more. You can navigate from one result to the next, or you can highlight all results at once, then apply another format or replace the words by other text.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	hd_id6226081				0	is	The Find & Replace dialog				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id6702780				0	is	To find text within the whole document, open the Find & Replace dialog without any active text selection. If you want to search only a part of your document, first select that part of text, then open the Find & Replace dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	hd_id3158970				0	is	To Find Text				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id6957304				0	is	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Find & Replace\</emph\> to open the Find & Replace dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id2164677				0	is	Enter the text to find in the \<emph\>Search for\</emph\> text box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id5684072				0	is	Either click \<emph\>Find\</emph\> or \<emph\>Find All\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id4377269				0	is	When you click \<emph\>Find\</emph\>, Writer will show you the next text that is equal to your entry. You can watch and edit the text, then click \<emph\>Find\</emph\> again to advance to the next found text. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id1371807				0	is	If you closed the dialog, you can press a key combination (Ctrl+Shift+F) to find the next text without opening the dialog. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id924100				0	is	Alternatively, you can use the icons at the lower right of the document to navigate to the next text or to any other object in the document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id9359416				0	is	When you click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Find All\</item\>, Writer selects all text that is equal to your entry. Now you can for example set all found text to bold, or apply a character style to all at once.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	hd_id5891598				0	is	To Replace Text				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id1780755				0	is	Unlike searching text, replacing text cannot be restricted to the current selection only.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id2467421				0	is	Choose Edit - Find & Replace to open the Find & Replace dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id4286935				0	is	Enter the text to search in the \<emph\>Search for \</emph\>text box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id9959410				0	is	Enter the text to replace the found text in the \<emph\>Replace with\</emph\> text box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id24109				0	is	Either click \<emph\>Replace\</emph\> or \<emph\>Replace All\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id703451				0	is	When you click \<emph\>Replace\</emph\>, Writer will search the whole document for the text in the \<emph\>Search for\</emph\> box, starting at the current cursor position. When text is found, Writer highlights the text and waits for your response. Click \<emph\>Replace\</emph\> to replace the highlighted text in the document with the text in the \<emph\>Replace with\</emph\> text box. Click \<emph\>Find\</emph\> to advance to the next found text without replacing the current selection.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id7540818				0	is	When you click \<emph\>Replace All\</emph\>, Writer replaces all text that matches your entry.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	hd_id9908444				0	is	To Find Styles				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id8413953				0	is	You want to find all text in your document to which a certain Paragraph Style is assigned, for example the "Heading 2" style.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id2696920				0	is	Choose Edit - Find & Replace to open the Find & Replace dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id896938				0	is	Click \<emph\>More Options\</emph\> to expand the dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
