helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id5597094				0	is	Fleiri kostir				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id9919431				0	is	The similarity search can find text that is almost the same as your search text. You can set the number of characters that are allowed to differ.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id8533280				0	is	Check the \<emph\>Similarity search\</emph\> option and optionally click the \<emph\>...\</emph\> button to change the settings. (Setting all three numbers to 1 works fine for English text.)				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id4646748				0	is	When you have enabled Asian language support under \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Language Settings - Languages\</emph\>, the Find & Replace dialog offers options to search Asian text.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	hd_id2489394				0	is	The Navigator				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id9934385				0	is	The Navigator is the main tool for finding and selecting objects. You can also use the Navigator to move and arrange chapters, providing an outline view to your document. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id4159062				0	is	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Navigator\</emph\> to open the Navigator window.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id7421796				0	is	Use the Navigator for inserting objects, links and references within the same document or from other open documents. See the \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/navigator.xhp\"\>Navigator\</link\> guide for more information.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id6417432				0	is	Click the icon with the blue circle at the bottom right part of your document to open the small \<emph\>Navigation\</emph\> window.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\finding.xhp	0	help	par_id4639728				0	is	Use the small Navigation window to quickly jump to the next object or find the next text in your document.				20181231 09:50:43
