helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	hd_id3563951				0	is	\<variable id=\"smarttags\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/smarttags.xhp\"\>Using Smart Tags\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id368358				0	is	Smart Tags provide additional information and functionality to specified words in a Writer document. The available features can be different for different Smart Tags extensions.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	hd_id9298379				0	is	Installing Smart Tags				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id1827448				0	is	Smart Tags can be supplied as \<link href=\"text/shared/01/packagemanager.xhp\"\>extensions\</link\> to %PRODUCTNAME Writer. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id2508621				0	is	To install a Smart Tag, do one of the following:				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id3856013				0	is	Save the *.oxt extension file to your harddrive, then double-click the *.oxt file in your file manager. Alternatively, in %PRODUCTNAME choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Extension Manager\</item\> to open the Extension Manager, click Add and browse to the file.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id7814264				0	is	Click a Smart Tag *.oxt file link on a web page and open the link with the default application. This requires a properly configured Web browser.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	hd_id8142338				0	is	Aðgerðamerkisvalmynd				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id1917477				0	is	Any text in a Writer document can be marked with a Smart Tag, by default a magenta colored underline. You can change the color in \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - Appearance\</item\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id192266				0	is	When you point to a Smart Tag, a tip help informs you to Ctrl-click to open the Smart Tags menu. If you don't use a mouse, position the cursor inside the marked text and open the context menu by Shift+F10.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id1998962				0	is	In the Smart Tags menu you see the available actions that are defined for this Smart Tag. Choose an option from the menu. The \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Smart Tags Options\</item\> command opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040700.xhp\"\>Smart Tags\</link\> page of Tools - Autocorrect Options.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	hd_id2376476				0	is	To Enable and Disable Smart Tags				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id349131				0	is	When you have installed at least one Smart Tags extension, you see the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/06040700.xhp\"\>Smart Tags\</link\> page in \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools - Autocorrect Options\</item\>. Use this dialog to enable or disable Smart Tags and to manage the installed tags.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\smarttags.xhp	0	help	par_id1216467				0	is	Text that is recognized as a Smart Tag is not checked by the automatic spellcheck.				20181231 09:50:43
