helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\section_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3155917				0	is	You can insert new sections, or links to sections in other documents into the current document. If you insert a section as a link, the content of the link changes when you modify the source document.				20181231 09:50:43
