helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_tab_innumbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3155909				0	is	To move a numbered or bulleted paragraph down one outline level, click at the beginning of the paragraph, and then press Tab.				20181231 09:50:43
