helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN105F6				0	is	\<variable id=\"print_brochure\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/print_brochure.xhp\"\>Prenta bækling\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN10614				0	is	You can print a Writer document as a brochure or a booklet. That is, Writer prints two pages on each side of the paper, so that when you fold the paper, you can read the document as a book.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN106DE				0	is	When you create a document that you want to print as a brochure, use portrait orientation for the pages. Writer applies the brochure layout when you print the document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN1061A				0	is	To Print a Brochure				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN10621				0	is	Veldu \<emph\>Skrá - Prenta\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN106B6				0	is	In the \<emph\>Print\</emph\> dialog, click \<emph\>Properties\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_idN1070E				0	is	In the properties dialog for your printer, set the paper orientation to landscape.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_brochure.xhp	0	help	par_id8947416				0	is	If your printer prints duplex, and because brochures always print in landscape mode, you should use the "duplex - short edge" setting in your printer setup dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
