helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3145099				0	is	To accept a correction, click the suggestion, and then click \<emph\>Change\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3156241				0	is	Edit the sentence in the upper text box, and then click \<emph\>Change\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
