helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	bm_id8186284				0	is	\<bookmark_value\>rulers;using rulers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>horizontal rulers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>vertical rulers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>indents; setting on rulers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>page margins on rulers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>table cells;adjusting the width on rulers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>showing;rulers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>hiding;rulers\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>adjusting page margins and cell widths\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
