helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	par_idN1067D				0	is	To show or hide rulers, choose \<emph\>View - Ruler\</emph\>. To show the vertical ruler, choose \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040200.xhp\" name=\"Writer - View\"\>\<emph\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - View\</emph\>\</link\>, and then select \<emph\>Vertical ruler\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Ruler\</emph\> area.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149686				0	is	Adjusting Page Margins				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	par_id3155175				0	is	The margins of a page are indicated by the filled areas at the ends of the rulers.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149038				0	is	Changing Indents				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	par_id3153631				0	is	Indents are adjusted with the three small triangles on the horizontal ruler.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	par_id3152776	26			0	is	To change the left or the right paragraph indent, select the paragraph(s) that you want change the indent for, drag the bottom left or the bottom right triangle on the horizontal ruler to a new location. 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	par_id3145769				0	is	To change the first line indent of a selected paragraph, drag the top left triangle on the horizontal ruler to a new location.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\ruler.xhp	0	help	par_id3149164				0	is	You can also double-click anywhere on the horizontal ruler, and adjust the indents in the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05030000.xhp\" name=\"Paragraph\"\>\<emph\>Paragraph\</emph\>\</link\> dialog.				20181231 09:50:43
