helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149487				0	is	\<bookmark_value\>text frames; inserting/editing/linking\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>editing;text frames\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>inserting;text frames\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>resizing;text frames, by mouse\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>scaling; text frames, by mouse\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>links;text frames\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>text flow; from frame to frame\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>frames; linking\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>printing;hiding text frames from printing\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149487				0	is	\<variable id=\"text_frame\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/text_frame.xhp\" name=\"Inserting, Editing, and Linking Text Frames\"\>Inserting, Editing, and Linking Text Frames\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3149842				0	is	A text frame is a container for text and graphics that you can place anywhere on a page. You can also use a frame to apply a column layout to text.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156104				0	is	To Insert a Text Frame				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3149961				0	is	Select the text that you want to include in the frame.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3149602				0	is	Choose \<emph\>Insert - Frame\</emph\>, and click OK.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145115				0	is	To Edit a Text Frame				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3149578				0	is	To edit the contents of a text frame, click in the frame, and make the changes that you want.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3156239				0	is	To edit a frame, select the frame, right-click, and then choose a formatting option. You can also right-click the selected frame, and choose \<emph\>Frame\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3156261				0	is	To resize a text frame, click an edge of the frame, and drag one of the edges or corners of the frame. Hold down Shift while you drag to maintain the proportion of the frame.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153386				0	is	To Hide Text From Printing				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3154262				0	is	Any Writer text frame can be set to a mode which allows viewing the text on screen, but hides the text from printing.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3154858				0	is	Select the text frame (you see the eight handles).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3155875				0	is	Choose \<emph\>Format - Frame/Object - Options\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3155899				0	is	In the \<emph\>Properties\</emph\> area, unmark the \<emph\>Print\</emph\> check box and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148701				0	is	To Link Text Frames				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3149986				0	is	You can link Writer text frames so that their contents automatically flow from one frame to another.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_frame.xhp	0	help	par_id3153025				0	is	Click the edge of a frame that you want to link. Selection handles appear on the edges of the frame.				20181231 09:50:43
