helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	par_id3153390				0	is	For example, to change the bulleting symbol, click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Options\</item\> tab, click the browse button (\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>...\</item\>) next to \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Character\</item\>, and then select a special character. You can also click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Graphics\</item\> tab, and then click a symbol style in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Selection\</item\> area.				20181231 09:50:43
