helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\autotext.xhp	0	help	par_id3145668	30			0	is	You can also type the shortcut for an AutoText entry, and then press F3, or click the arrow next to the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>AutoText\</item\> icon on the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Insert\</item\> bar, and then choose an AutoText entry. 				20181231 09:50:43
