helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3153404				0	is	Veldu \<emph\>Setja inn - Kafli\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3153127				0	is	Type a name in the \<emph\>New Section\</emph\> box, and then select the \<emph\>Link\</emph\> check box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3149642				0	is	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>File Name\</item\> box, type the name of the file that you want to insert, or click the browse button (\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>...\</item\>) and locate the file.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3149968				0	is	If the target text document contains sections, you can select the section that you want to insert in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Sections\</item\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3149619				0	is	If you want, set the formatting options for the section.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3149862				0	is	Smelltu á \<emph\>Setja inn\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\textdoc_inframe.xhp	0	help	par_id3145099				0	is	$[officename] automatically updates the contents of the inserted section whenever the source document is changed. To manually update the contents of the section, choose \<emph\>Tools - Update - Update All\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
