helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\reset_format.xhp	0	help	par_id3154091				0	is	You can quickly exit manual formatting by pressing the right-arrow key. For example, if you have pressed Ctrl+B to apply the bold typeface to the text that you type, press the right arrow to return to the default character format of the paragraph.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\reset_format.xhp	0	help	par_id3155854				0	is	To reset all direct formatting of existing text, select that text, then choose the menu command \<emph\>Format - Default Formatting\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
