helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_direct_cursor.xhp	0	help	par_id3155921				0	is	To set the behavior of the direct cursor, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Writer - Formatting Aids\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_direct_cursor.xhp	0	help	par_idN106A3				0	is	On the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools\</item\> bar, click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Direct Cursor\</item\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3149846\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_shadowcursor.png\" width=\"0.222in\" height=\"0.222in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149846\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>.				20181231 09:50:43
