helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3155918	31			0	is	By default, $[officename] moves words that do not fit on a line to the next line. If you want, you can use automatic or manual hyphenation to avoid this behavior: 				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155864				0	is	Sjálfvirk orðskipting				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3147414				0	is	Automatic hyphenation inserts hyphens where they are needed in a paragraph. This option is only available for paragraph styles and individual paragraphs.				20181231 09:50:43
