helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help					0	is	To Manually Hyphenate Single Words				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3153363				0	is	To quickly insert a hyphen, click in the word where you want to add the hyphen, and then press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Hyphen(-).				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\using_hyphen.xhp	0	help	par_id3154244				0	is	If you insert a manual hyphen in a word, the word is only hyphenated at the manual hyphen. No additional automatic hyphenation is applied for this word. A word with a manual hyphen will be hyphenated without regard to the settings on the \<emph\>Text Flow\</emph\> tab page.				20181231 09:50:43
