helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_line.xhp	0	help	par_id3150231				0	is	You can also insert one of these lines by dragging it from the \<emph\>Rulers\</emph\> folder in the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\> into the current document.				20181231 09:50:43
