helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	par_id3154664				0	is	You can have $[officename] automatically check spelling while you type and underline possible misspelt words with a red wavy line.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154678				0	is	To Check Spelling Automatically While You Type				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	par_id3155531	42			0	is	Activate the \<emph\>AutoSpellcheck \</emph\>icon on the Standard bar.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	par_id3155569	33			0	is	Right-click a word with a red wavy underline, and then choose a suggested replacement word from the list, or from the \<emph\>AutoCorrect \</emph\>submenu.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	par_id3147759	6			0	is	If you choose a word from the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>AutoCorrect\</item\> submenu, the underlined word and the replacement word are automatically added to the AutoCorrect list for the current language. To view the AutoCorrect list, choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Tools – AutoCorrect Options\</item\>, and then click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Replace\</item\> tab.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	par_id3147819				0	is	You can also add the underlined word to your custom dictionary by choosing \<emph\>Add\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_spellcheck.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147220				0	is	To Exclude Words From the Spellcheck				20181231 09:50:43
