helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3145637				0	is	Opens a dialog to edit the contents of the field.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\fields.xhp	0	help	par_id3151244				0	is	Placeholder, hidden text, insert reference, variable, database, and user-defined fields display a help tip when you rest the mouse pointer over the field in a document. To enable this feature, ensure that the Extended Tips option (\<item type=\"menuitem\"\>What's This?\</item\>) is selected in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Help\</item\> menu.				20181231 09:50:43
