helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145087				0	is	\<variable id=\"references\"\>\<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/references.xhp\" name=\"Inserting Cross-References\"\>Inserting Cross-References\</link\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3159263				0	is	Cross-references allow you to jump to specific text passages and objects in a single document. A cross-reference consists of a target and a reference that are inserted as \<link href=\"text/swriter/guide/fields.xhp\" name=\"fields\"\>fields\</link\> in the document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3155860				0	is	Objects with captions and bookmarks can be used as targets.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149833				0	is	Cross-Referencing Text				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3149846				0	is	Before you can insert a cross-reference, you must first specify the targets in your text.				20181231 09:50:43
