helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3149634				0	is	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Type\</item\> list, select “Set Reference”.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\references.xhp	0	help	par_id3149614				0	is	Type a name for the target in the \<emph\>Name\</emph\> box. The selected text is displayed in the \<emph\>Value\</emph\> box.				20181231 09:50:43
