helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_centervert.xhp	0	help	par_id3149615				0	is	To hide the borders of the frame, select the frame, and then choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Format - Frame/Object\</item\>. Click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Borders\</item\> tab, and then click in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Set No Border\</item\> box in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Line Arrangement\</item\> area.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_centervert.xhp	0	help	par_id3145098				0	is	To resize the frame, drag the edges of the frame.				20181231 09:50:43
