helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156094				0	is	Inserts the selected AutoText into the current document.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02120000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148788				0	is	If you insert an unformatted AutoText entry into a paragraph, the entry is formatted with the current paragraph style.				20181231 09:50:43
