helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090006.xhp	0	help	par_id3147739				0	is	If you want, you can assign a condition that must be met before the contents of the "Any Record" and "Next Record" fields are inserted. The default condition is "True", that is, the condition is always true if you do not change the condition text.				20181231 09:50:43
