helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3155142				0	is	\<variable id=\"reftext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>This is where you insert the references or referenced fields into the current document. References are referenced fields within the same document or within sub-documents of a master document.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3159197				0	is	The advantage of entering a cross-reference as a field is that you do not have to adjust the references manually every time you change the document. Just update the fields with F9 and the references in the document are updated too.				20181231 09:50:43
