helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3147422				0	is	Set target for a referenced field. Under \<emph\>Name\</emph\>, enter a name for the reference. When inserting the reference, the name will then appear as an identification in the list box \<emph\>Selection\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3149556				0	is	In an HTML document, reference fields entered this way will be ignored. For the target in HTML documents, you have to \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04040000.xhp\" name=\"insert a bookmark\"\>insert a bookmark\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3150548				0	is	Setja tilvísun				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3147746				0	is	Inserting a reference to another position in the document. The corresponding text position has to be defined with "Set Reference" first. Otherwise, inserting a reference by choosing a field name under \<emph\>Selection\</emph\> is not possible.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3146344				0	is	In master documents, you can also reference from one sub-document to another. Note that the reference name will not appear in the selection field and has to be entered "by hand".				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3149847				0	is	In an HTML document, reference fields entered this way will be ignored. For referenced fields in HTML documents, you have to \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05020400.xhp\" name=\"insert a hyperlink\"\>insert a hyperlink\</link\>.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id2408825				0	is	Fyrirsagnir				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id9988402				0	is	The Selection box shows a list of all headings in the order of their appearance in the document.				20181231 09:50:43
