helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3156032	17			0	is	In a master document, targets that are in different sub-documents are not displayed in the\<emph\> Selection\</emph\> list. If you want to insert a reference to the target, you must type the path and the name in the \<emph\>Name \</emph\>box.				20181231 09:50:43
