helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\mailmerge07.xhp	0	help	par_idN10556				0	is	The Mail Merge Wizard creates a single merged document with page breaks between each recipient. When you reach this page of the wizard, the names and the addresses of the recipients are contained in the document.				20181231 09:50:43
