helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02110000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153011	14			0	is	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click here to set a reminder at the current cursor position. You can define up to five reminders. To jump to a reminder, click the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110100.xhp\" name=\"Navigation\"\>\<emph\>Navigation\</emph\>\</link\> icon, in the \<emph\>Navigation\</emph\> window click the \<emph\>Reminder\</emph\> icon, and then click the \<emph\>Previous\</emph\> or \<emph\>Next\</emph\> button.\</ahelp\>Click here to set a reminder at the current cursor position. You can define up to five reminders. To jump to a reminder, click the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/02110100.xhp\" name=\"Navigation\"\>Navigation\</link\> icon, in the Navigation window click the Reminder icon, and then click the Previous or Next button.				20181231 09:50:43
