helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149096				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_HYPHENATE\"\>Inserts the hyphen at the indicated position.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154829				0	is	Fjarlægja				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149821				0	is	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:PUSHBUTTON:RID_SVXDLG_HYPHENATE:BTN_HYPH_DELETE\"\>Removes the current hyphenation point from the displayed word.\</ahelp\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	is	Resizing and Moving Frames, Objects With the Keyboard				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154506				0	is	\<bookmark_value\>moving;objects and frames\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>objects;moving and resizing with keyboard\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>resizing;objects and frames, by keyboard\</bookmark_value\>				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154506				0	is	Resizing and Moving Frames, Objects With the Keyboard				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145248				0	is	You can resize and move selected frames and objects with the keyboard.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148771				0	is	To move a selected frame or object, press an arrow key. To move by one pixel, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then press an arrow key.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150762				0	is	To resize a selected frame or object, first press Ctrl+Tab. Now one of the handles blinks to show that it is selected. To select another handle, press Ctrl+Tab again. Press an arrow key to resize the object by one grid unit. To resize by one pixel, hold down \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>, and then press an arrow key.				20181231 09:50:43
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04130100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149294				0	is	The increment by which you move an object with the keyboard is determined by the document grid. To change the properties of the document grid, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01050100.xhp\" name=\"Text document - Grid\"\>%PRODUCTNAME Writer - Grid\</link\>\</emph\>.				20181231 09:50:43
